1. Help file for HackWB is missing in the version found at linc.cis.upenn.edu

2. What I tried to do was to create several "NewGame" icons with different 
options. I selected NewGame, edited it and tried to save it under a 
different name which seems to result in a GURU every time.
I tried copying the NewGame.info file from DOS and finally figured out that
I have to put those files in the "save" drawer to make them visible for
HackWB. I managed to edit the options, but soon discovered that every
time I started a game the options were set back to default and rewritten
to my icon. I fixed it by write-protecting my icons but it doesn't seem
right...

3. The game takes an awfully long time to load, so I was happily delighted
when I discovered that the second game started from HackWB takes almost no
time at all. Not for very long though - the second game crashes inevitably
after a couple of levels. (I only tried four times, so it still can be
a coincidence)

